{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_8_level_st_08-02","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"st_08-02","title":"失語，產自多言","storyCode":"M8-2","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_08-02.txt","sourceHash":"0b2bee9edd4881ea095d317de81ee2947934485bdb3a3bb65ac955bfe1a19939","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"中央區\n一段時間之前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"為什麼你認定阿米婭她們在指揮塔前......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不會遭遇塔露拉的精銳部隊？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這正是陰謀家的難處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"一個軍閥，或者一個暴虐且狡詐的君王，他們的要塞向來易守難攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他們知道自己的所作所為一定會遭到瘋狂的報復，他們會用優勢的兵力和先進的武器，佈置堅實的防守。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，既然塔露拉的暴君行徑已經被證實是種表演，那麼，她不會這麼做。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你哪來的自信？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"經驗，理論，現象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有自信，我只是能推演出事實。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......我其實也期待你能給出自己的意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你覺得沉默就已經是種意見了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那謝謝你的理解。"}]},{"label":"我想聽聽理由。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我的想法能夠贏得你的認同......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你會不會覺得，我會因此而感到欣喜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"尊重是雙向的。如果你重視我的觀點，並且得出有益的結論，那麼我也會將你的觀點納入考量。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉在維護自己的形象。她需要讓普通的感染者尊重她，讓薩卡茲雇傭兵服從她，讓遊擊隊信任她，讓狂熱者崇拜她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"她就必須讓自己和他們之間的距離清晰可見，讓這些人能夠相互審視。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"根據整合運動的一系列表現，我們可以很清楚地知道，整合運動的其他領袖對塔露拉的行為並沒有太多認識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是已經窺見她陰謀的愛國者，也沒有能力在急劇變化中力挽狂瀾。假使他能殺了塔露拉，也一樣改變不了整合運動傾頹的趨勢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"何況，塔露拉在腦海中勾勒這個利用感染者的陰謀......她需要的時間，可能比現在整合運動存在的時間更長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜想，整合運動迄今為止的所有行動，都是以一個前提去設計的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“整合運動將在事件結束後毀滅。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉會將尖銳而隱秘的力量分散在疆土各處，在需要的時候召集他們，讓他們在合適的時機出現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我想，烏薩斯帝國的第三集團軍其實是不會允許任何感染者自由行動的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，整合運動現在的所有作為，都在他們的容忍範圍之內。這種表面上的暴力、缺乏紀律與散漫，是第三集團軍所樂見的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"仔細想想，他們會僅僅只是旁觀嗎？他們如此冒險，就真的甘願只是讓塔露拉一人操縱一城甚至一國的局勢嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，這甚至也是塔露拉的砝碼，用來騙取烏薩斯軍隊的力量......讓他們蟄伏在某處，只等著事態變化到即將超脫她掌控的地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那時，她就可以名正言順地......動用她根本無法觸及的力量。如她所願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但這需要時間。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你都這麼說了，她為什麼還不是一個暴君？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"因為現在的整合運動想要一個這樣的領袖，卻不真的需要這樣一個領袖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"暴君珍惜自己的羽翼，即使他們往往因為短視或狂躁而肆意地摧毀了它們，而後又真情實感地痛哭流涕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"陰謀家不會。暴君有棋子，陰謀家也有；但暴君自己同在棋盤，陰謀家卻坐在棋盤之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"假設她有人性，她就可能犯錯。但是對一個合格的陰謀家來說，當陰謀行駛在軌道上時，即使自身死了，她的陰謀一樣會繼續自然發展。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們的行動沒有用嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是那樣，我們根本就不會帶著羅德島的雇員們出生入死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"僅僅是殺了她自然是沒有用的。所以，我們要在各個部分各個地方，分解她的陰謀，對抗她的指令，令她的陰謀失效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們不能停止一艘艦船繼續向前，那麼我們就把它拆成碎片，讓它在到達目的地時只剩下無害的空殼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，也許我的說法會讓你誤會。我們還是得停下切爾諾伯格這座核心城的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你擔憂過阿米婭他們是否可能會遭遇突發事態......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我認為，擺在我們面前的，這才是真正的突發事態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群化薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_091","isRemote":false,"text":"W，W。W在哪？W更強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群化薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_091","isRemote":false,"text":"不要，不要進入......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"能和他們交流嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩卡茲某部族語言）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群化薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_091","isRemote":false,"text":"地下充斥黑暗。黑暗滋生邪惡。邪惡帶來痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群化薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_091","isRemote":false,"text":"太多的，痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"（薩卡茲某部族語言）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群化薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_091","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，分享我們的痛苦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。即使他們不是卡茲戴爾出身，也應該對母語類的暗示有所反應。他們的主動思維能力已經損壞了。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你說的那些詞句能影響他們？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"原本是應該能的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......這不是常理性的手段。不要好奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果我用這種手段都不能喚醒他們的意識，那他們確實已經失去了思考能力而不是單純的表達能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是他們的腦活動被封鎖了，還是他們的神經系統被感染器官擾亂了......我們剩下的時間尚不夠我們探明問題的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"只是依據事實判斷，我想可能凶多吉少。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他們似乎不會攻擊我們。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他們在阻止我們深入。深度感染的薩卡茲雇傭兵，在這個區域的，大概有六個左右，大多數時間裡只是進行著看似無意識的漫遊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的活動範圍不會延伸到這個通道之外，而現在這些深度感染者是在意識到我們的行為後才聚集在這裡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"並且，只要我們不跨過界線，他們就不會採取進一步的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"偵查幹員，能檢測出我們與石棺之間線性距離嗎？根據我提供的波形來判定位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......1.4公里。準確數字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"1453米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果我沒算錯，那麼，之前整合運動與薩卡茲特殊感染者發生衝突的位置，距離市政廳的距離也恰巧是1.4公里左右。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們原本打算從市政廳下方的避難通道進入石棺區，現在，那個出口可能已經被這些薩卡茲特殊感染者佔據了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一個未經證實的猜想，博士......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"什麼樣的猜想？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道目的是什麼，但這些薩卡茲特殊感染者可能是在阻止其他人進入石棺區，而這個控制區域的大小，也恰好是1.4公里。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你說的也許是對的，但是目的呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"至少不再是這些薩卡茲原本的目的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"源自卡茲戴爾，可悲的薩卡茲人，無論在哪裡都會成為工具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我認為，感染者現在的處境也與薩卡茲相似，現在的這些薩卡茲只能在充滿仇恨和失去一切間選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......本來，事情該有所改變。我們是能夠改變的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"失去了家鄉的提卡茲，變成了無根之人薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我們面前的這些薩卡茲，則連人都算不上了。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你要怎麼做？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"諸位幹員，檢查你們的防化裝備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們面對的也許是二級緊急感染事態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們要在盡可能減少損耗的情況下，盡可能多地停止特殊感染者的運作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們有段時間沒有出面解決緊急感染事態了，這身行頭，簡直就像是烏薩斯的感染者糾察隊。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"感染者糾察隊？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我無法否認的一點是，我們配備的防化設備與烏薩斯對感染者的殘暴統治象徵......分享著同一個原型設計。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然，我們在行為上和感染者糾察隊有著本質的不同，但我也只能希望我們真能繼續保持這種本質差異，不因種種外力所迫變得面目全非。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是我們對很多事情的期望。和我一段時間前對你說的那樣。希望你也如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——————————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"————這是，陳長官的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"他向哪個方向去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"西方。很快就能到達輝蹄城的禁區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......這一切是他謀劃好的。為了確認協定簽署區的安全情況，萊塔尼亞外擴了衝突禁區，和我們的禁區重疊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們能夠潛入進去，殺死科西切，奪回小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不。他做好了準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......這次會面，孿生女皇直接派遣了女皇之聲，隨行的武裝力量不在少數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"女皇們剛登基不久，一旦科西切有意引爆外交衝突，我們一切的逾矩行為都可能成為女皇們彰示威權的藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不能給科西切更多傷害龍門乃至大炎的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"舅舅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"暉潔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"舅舅......不要怪小塔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有責怪她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......那你罵我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有做錯什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我答應她要和她一起走的。可是我害怕了......我......我鬆開手了。我沒和她一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她的眼神，很害怕。我很害怕，她也很害怕。我......我一定做錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......暉潔，這是她的錯，不是你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？可，可舅舅你說不會怪她的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但她......但她不是做錯了嗎？做錯了也......不會被罵嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"她不知道真相。這個真相不該被任何人知道，所以她肯定會犯錯，哪怕不是現在，將來也會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......很多情況下，犯錯是不該被責罰的。我們不僅會犯錯，還會犯很多錯。有些錯，我們一定會犯，躲不開，避不過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉只是犯了那個她一定會犯的錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的話還叫犯錯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，依然還是。這片土地不因一件事一定發生就寬容待它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"嚴苛的土地，嚴苛的人民，嚴苛的統治。除了對錯，它們什麼都不在乎，好像對錯才是它們的生命，而不是呼吸和吞咽......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說的這些我不懂，舅舅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以......小塔她還會回來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"——我不知道，暉潔。我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗚......那小塔她因為我......不會回來了嗎？都怪我......都怪我......小塔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"暉潔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"把你的眼淚擦掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，哭吧。給你五分鐘，哭完之後，如果你不再流眼淚了，我就告訴你該怎麼辦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哇......！小塔......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"魏彥吾望向天空。他本想弓下身子安慰矮小的女孩，躊躇之後，他覺得自己不配。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你不哭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。我想小塔回來。我該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我會教你很多事，教你怎麼管理城市，怎麼對抗惡棍，怎麼對待朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"照我說的做，塔露拉就有可能回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要，要怎麼做？小塔真的可能回來嗎？舅舅會不會騙我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......媽媽......媽媽說，說你只會騙人，我......我真的可以相信你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"也許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我也犯下了一個巨大的錯誤，導致你的母親終一生都恨我入骨，至死都沒能放開。她這麼說情有可原。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"但錯誤是可以被彌補的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"暉潔，聽好。正確行事值得你努力一生，糾正錯誤，卻值得人押上性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉的離去是一樁錯誤。這樁錯誤帶來的所有後果，我都會承擔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，暉潔。快快長大吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"長大以後會怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你的話，長大的你......就能改變一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳暉潔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"也許。或者說，只要你相信，它就是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我會教你劍術，暉潔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"赤霄的劍術。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“拔刀之招，當破即破。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彥吾"]}]}
